00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.720
where you can sign up
for free daily updates

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.760
on the latest in nutrition research
via bite-sized videos and articles.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.120
Everything on the
website is free.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.040
There’s no ads,

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.760
no corporate sponsorships,
no kickbacks.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:43.000
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.040
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.440
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:53.415
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

